@host = http://localhost:8001

### Create an order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "cust-1",
  "items": [
    {"sku": "BIG", "quantity": 2, "unit_price": "10.00"}
    ]
}

### Get an order (paste an order_id from the response above)
GET {{host}}/orders/cece7a27-3567-4f63-8286-d6e4328018e0